    <md:title>1.10.3: Self Check</md:title>
    <md:uuid>83d976c4-59b7-4c48-9fe5-6dc836ac1fef</md:uuid>
  </metadata>
  <content>
  <section>
    <para dir="ltr">A coin jar contains 75 cents and only contains quarters and nickels. Write an equation that relates the number of quarters, \( q \), the number of nickels, \( n \), and the amount of money, in cents, in the coin jar.</para>
  </section>
</content>
